    "breadcrumb": "Swing Catalyst atbalsts \u003e Aparatūra",
    "content": "Kuri palaišanas monitori tiek atbalstīti? Swing Catalyst integrējas ar vairākiem palaišanas monitoriem, sākot no radara līdz kamerām balstītām tehnloģijām.\nPiezīme: Swing Catalyst palaišanas monitoru integrāciju veic tikai golfam šobrīd.\nRažotājs / Marka Modelis Integrācijas tips Komentārs Palīdzības centra raksts\nForesight\nGCQuad, GCHawk,\nGC3\nTiešā\nHow to use Foresight GC3 / Bushnell Launch Pro with Swing Catalyst\nForesight QuadMAX, Falcon Direct Available in version 24.1 and newer How to use Foresight GC3 / Bushnell Launch Pro with Swing Catalyst\nForesight GC2 / GC2 + HMT Direct Disabled by default in versions 10.1 and newer How to use Foresight GC2 \u0026 HMT with Swing Catalyst\nForesight GC2 (Simulator integration) FSX 2020 software FSX 2020 or older. Does not work for other launch monitors than GC2. How to use Foresight GC2 \u0026 HMT with Swing Catalyst\nBushnell Launch Pro / BLP Direct\nHow to use Bushnell BLP with Swing Catalyst\nFlightScope X1, X2, X2 Elite, X3, Xi, Xi+ FlightScope software FlightScope software v11 or older How to use FlightScope with Swing Catalyst\nFlightScope Mevo+ X2, X2.1, X2 Elite \u0026 X3 Xi \u0026 Xi Plus Xi TP Xi Range Direct Can only be connected to one device. If Swing Catalyst is connected FS Golf cannot be connected at the same time. How to use FlightScope Mevo+ with Swing Catalyst\nFull Swing Golf FS Golf, Pro Studio, E6 1.6 Direct\nHow to use Full Swing Golf with Swing Catalyst\nTrackman 1, 2, 3, 3e \u0026 4 TPS software Integration is limited to existing customers only How to use Trackman with Swing Catalyst\nLast updated: 2026-01-06 | View on official support site",
